  "body": "NOW ASKING $1,495,000 – NEGOTIABLE!\r\n\r\n33A Jillteresa Crescent, Half Moon Bay\r\n\r\nThe price has changed. The opportunity is here. The vendor is ready to sell!\r\n\r\nIf you’ve been searching for a modern, spacious family home in the highly desirable Macleans College zone, now is the time to act.\r\n\r\nBuilt in 2022, this beautifully presented five-bedroom residence combines contemporary comfort, versatile family living and an exceptional location. With a motivated vendor and a new asking price of $1,495,000, serious buyers are encouraged to inspect and make their move.\r\n\r\nWhy Buyers Will Love This Home:\r\n\r\n\r\n• Exceptional Value – $1,495,000 Negotiable: A compelling opportunity for buyers looking to secure a modern five-bedroom home in this sought-after location.\r\n\r\n• Five Bedrooms, Three Bathrooms: Generous accommodation for growing families, including two ensuite bedrooms.\r\n\r\n• Upstairs & Downstairs Master Suites: A flexible arrangement ideal for extended families, visiting relatives or multigenerational living.\r\n\r\n• Main kitchen + Kitchenette: Additional convenience and flexibility for busy households and larger families.\r\n\r\n• Built in 2022: Enjoy the comfort and contemporary appeal of a modern home.\r\n\r\n• Sun-Filled Living & Outdoor Entertaining: Bright, welcoming interiors flow to an outdoor deck, perfect for relaxing and spending time with family.\r\n\r\n• Double Internal-Access Garage: Secure parking and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\n• 368m² Freehold Section: Enjoy the benefits of freehold ownership.\r\n\r\n• Triple School Zone: Zoned for Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Pigeon Mountain School — an outstanding combination for families prioritising education.\r\n\r\nA Location Families Love\r\n\r\nPositioned in desirable Half Moon Bay, the property offers convenient access to local amenities, shopping, parks, coastal attractions and the wider East Auckland community.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re upsizing, relocating into the Macleans College zone or looking for a flexible home for extended family living, 33A Jillteresa Crescent deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nMOTIVATED VENDOR – ALL SERIOUS OFFERS ENCOURAGED!\r\n\r\nThe auction campaign has concluded, and the property is now offered at an attractive asking price of $1,495,000, negotiable.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss your chance to secure this modern family home.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
